-- Opens files, transfers their contents, creates directories, and joins paths.
use io as streams.
public use "fs" function open(path of type text, mode of type text) of type failable pointer to streams.Stream.
public use "fs" function read(path of type text) of type failable text.
public use "fs" function write(path of type text, content of type text) of type failable nothing.
public use "fs" function directory(path of type text) of type failable nothing.
public use "fs" function join(left of type text, right of type text) of type failable text.
-- Compatibility module for file; new code should import file.
public use "fs" function flush(stream pointer to streams.Stream) giving failable nothing.
public use "fs" function seek(stream pointer to streams.Stream, offset integer 64, origin text) giving failable nothing.
public use "fs" function position(stream pointer to streams.Stream) giving failable unsigned 64.
public use "fs" function size(stream pointer to streams.Stream) giving failable unsigned 64.
